    <description>Secure network utilities using Magic Wormhole code-based addressing.

Instead of IP addresses and port forwarding, users share human-readable codes like "7-guitar-sunset" to connect securely from anywhere.

## Features
- `wh nc` - Netcat-style bidirectional pipe
- `wh ssh` - SSH client over wormhole
- `wh scp` - Secure file copy
- `wh sftp` - Interactive SFTP client
- `wh curl/wget` - HTTP requests through wormhole
- `wh tunnel` - SSH-style port forwarding
- `wh identity` - WNS identity management

## Quick Start
```
# Listen on one machine
wh listen --http 8080
# Outputs: 7-guitar-sunset

# Connect from another
wh curl 7-guitar-sunset/api/data
```
    </description>
    <summary>Secure network utilities using Magic Wormhole code-based addressing</summary>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/bshuler/critical-wormhole-tools/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md</releaseNotes>
